Z||000010||beer_stud_21||09-03-2001||06:29 PM||||I second Hughs thoughts.  I'm tired of all the god damned bickering going on around here.....  I say ppl either A) Take a joke and laugh it off.  Its no big deal.  OR B) Settle things with people via private email.  That way the rest of us dont have to get involved.  If you dont like a person just scroll past their posts.  Its not very hard to do!<P>-Marlin<P>btw: Songman seems like a standup guy to me, but I dont know what all "goins on" is about....   So maybe hes just a big a$$ pretending to be to be a stand up guy...  hehe  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">      &lt;----   See that is intended to be funny!!  I hope Songman doesn't get all bent out of shape and come down here for a vacation and beat my a$$!  LOL. ||||reg||1
Z||000011||Songman||09-03-2001||07:02 PM||||Now I'm BENT! heheh<P>Chris, I appreciate the nice things you have said about me. And from others too. In this case I did ask to be judged. It is true that no matter what we do, sometimes people see us totally different than what we intend.. and in some cases, they see us differently then we really are no matter what we do.<P>I have had tiffs with people in the past and they have all been worked out. Some by talking to the people and finding neutral ground, others by just ignoring the person. I have said it before that as easy as the internet makes it for us to reach out and meet people from around the world, it is still hard to communicate. You can't read a person's facial expression over the internet, you can't hear the tone of their voice. I think that is the biggest cause of friction that we have. Of course, in some cases you just run across an a$$hole that wants to play big shot since he is safe at his house and will not be held accountable for the things he says... I think that is rare on our forum here.<P>I think if we all just remember that this is just an extension of real life and that none of us are perfect, and our way may work for us but it isn't right for everyone... then we'll all be just fine. I consider you all friends and will always look forward to meeting any of you in my travels... and that is how I think we should keep it.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||7
Z||000012||Sage||09-03-2001||11:42 PM||||No matter "how" you judge a man...you're wrong.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
