Z||000016||Butter||09-04-2001||05:00 PM||||Everyone has a disposition and that's the way I look at it.  Some of it you can see right off and some of it you cannot until you get to know them.  I've met Songman in person and thought he was a good guy.  This is not a judgement it was my observation and opinion.  Judgement is not left to us humans.  Sometimes we must assess a situation and act quickly but this is still not judgement.  <BR>As far as taking up for Songman I will not but I would back him up if he wanted or needed me too.||||reg||1
Z||000017||LT1 Chop Top||09-04-2001||11:21 PM||||I bought his 88 GT 2 years ago.  I am not sure if you are Chris or not, but Chris showed me around his shop w/ Ernie and we took Ernie's fiero and his out PCH and into the mountains to show me how well they perform (my first real non-test ride in a fiero).  Later that evening, we had dinner at Chris's place, very cool guy, and helpful.  I thought Ernie bought an RX7??||||reg||1
